  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_5416.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Onda vive este s&aacute;bado una doble jornada de solidaridad a trav&eacute;s del f&uacute;tbol base, tanto del CD Onda, que la celebra un a&ntilde;o m&aacute;s en La Cossa, como del CF Racing Onda, en l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic, donde ha colaborado tambi&eacute;n el equipo Adaponda de f&uacute;tbol sala.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutbolbaseonda13/img_5389.jpg\" alt=\"img_5389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutbolbaseonda13/img_5390.jpg\" alt=\"img_5390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutbolbaseonda13/img_5391.jpg\" alt=\"img_5391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutbolbaseonda13/img_5392.jpg\" alt=\"img_5392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutbolbaseonda13/img_5393.jpg\" alt=\"img_5393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutbolbaseonda13/img_5394.jpg\" alt=\"img_5394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutbolbaseonda13/img_5395.jpg\" alt=\"img_5395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutbolbaseonda13/img_5396.jpg\" alt=\"img_5396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadessolidariesfutb